The creation of followings diagrams is possible only if '''Traceability''' Capability is enabled.

To enabled such Capability, perform:
* From main menu, select '''Window > Preferences / General / Capabilities'''
* In '''Capabilities''' panel,  activate '''Capella Tools > Traceabilty'''
* Confirm with ''Apply and Close'' in '''Preferences''' dialog. 

== Traceability Diagram ==

{| border="1"
|-
| Trace
| [[Image:Images/icons/full/obj16/GenericTrace.gif]]
| Create a Generic Trace from PropertyValueGroup to an element.
|-
| Nodes
| [[Image:Images/icons/full/obj16/ShowHide.gif]]
| Creates or delete graphical objects on the diagrams corresponding to existing Elements. Removing a Element graphical object from the diagram does not delete the Element from the model. This tool does not modify the semantic model.
|-
| Show Related Elements
| [[Image:Images/icons/full/obj16/ShowHide.gif]]
| Show elements that are connected through traces.
|-
| Show All Related Elements
| [[Image:Images/icons/full/obj16/ShowHide.gif]]
| Show all elements that are connected through traces directly or indirectly.
|}

